# OpenDiffraction Licensing

The **OpenDiffraction** project provides both scientific datasets and open-source data generation software.

---

## 1. Dataset License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)

The synthetic diffraction data files, images, metadata manifests, and documentation generated by OpenDiffraction are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License.

You are free to:
- **Share** — copy and redistribute the material in any medium or format.
- **Adapt** — remix, transform, and build upon the material for any purpose, even commercially.

Under the following terms:
- **Attribution** — You must give appropriate credit, provide a link to the license, and indicate if changes were made.

Full legal code: [https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode)

